pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  # ===== NAV BAR =====
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"

  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: nav-t1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度一: Source</p>

  - elementId: nav-t2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度二: Propagation</p>

  - elementId: nav-t3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度三: Sink</p>

  - elementId: nav-t4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度四: Verification</p>

  - elementId: nav-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 40, 1280, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  # ===== TITLE & BADGE =====
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 880, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>FirmAgent — Fuzzing与LLM Agent的自动化PoC生成</p>

  - elementId: badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1050, 58, 170, 28]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1050, 58, 170, 28]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>NDSS 2026</p>

  # ===== LEFT COLUMN: 内容摘要 & 研究背景 =====
  - elementId: left-bar-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: left-subtitle-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>内容摘要</p>

  - elementId: left-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 142, 360, 190]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>结合Fuzzing能力与LLM Agent语义推理的固件漏洞发现与PoC生成框架。Fuzzing提供真实可达性证据，LLM负责语义理解与代码修复，自动组装可触发漏洞的PoC。在14款固件确认182个真实漏洞，精度91%。</p>

  - elementId: left-bar-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 348, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: left-subtitle-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 346, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>研究背景</p>

  - elementId: left-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 382, 360, 230]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>静态分析误报高且缺少PoC。Fuzzing难以独立覆盖深层Sink。单独LLM易在不可达路径上空推理。需要结合Fuzzing的真实执行证据与LLM的语义推理能力，形成漏洞发现与验证闭环。</p>

  # ===== MIDDLE COLUMN: 核心洞察 & 解决方案 =====
  - elementId: mid-bar-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: mid-subtitle-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [452, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>核心洞察</p>

  - elementId: mid-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 142, 360, 250]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Fuzzing的价值不仅是发现漏洞，更能为LLM提供真实可达性证据。LLM适合补足静态分析缺失的语义理解。漏洞发现最终目标应是可验证PoC，而非仅停留在静态告警。将合法请求骨架与语义约束结合，自动组装PoC。</p>

  - elementId: mid-bar-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 400, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: mid-subtitle-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [452, 398, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>解决方案</p>

  - elementId: mid-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 434, 360, 250]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>1. Fuzzing驱动信息收集：静态预分析+运行时插桩，提取服务处理函数与真实输入源。2. 反编译代码修复：LLM恢复IDA丢失的函数参数、控制流结构。3. 语义追踪与告警验证：迭代跨过程污点分析，识别净化逻辑。4. PoC生成：融合Fuzzing骨架与静态约束，组装完整可用PoC。</p>

  # ===== RIGHT COLUMN: 关键数据 =====
  - elementId: right-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [820, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: right-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [832, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>关键数据</p>

  # Card 1
  - elementId: card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 150, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 165, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>182</p>

  - elementId: card1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 215, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>个真实漏洞确认</p>

  # Card 2
  - elementId: card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 290, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 305, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>91%</p>

  - elementId: card2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 355, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>漏洞检测精度</p>

  # Card 3
  - elementId: card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 430, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 445, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>91.8%</p>

  - elementId: card3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 495, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>PoC直接触发率</p>

  # ===== FOOTER =====
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>网络设备Web服务安全研究</p>

  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>33 / 37</p>
